; village_mill.room - the river mill (design 04 section 3.1); the road runs under the trail floor to the east gate.
; One street at ground level (design 04 section 1, "Vila plana", no platforms in the air): the river trail floor (row 5) is one full jump (4 rows) up.
; The mill house's door is col 3 (WORLD-11); cols 4-13 of the street are a plank bridge over the river (rows 10-11), so the wheel stands in visible water and Ivo crosses on the planks ("Open a plank bridge (Recommended)", user, 2026-10-13).
; River trail gate: the barrier (col 30) stands on the trail floor (row 5) under the ledge (row 0), 4 cells of headroom; past it, a step (rows 3-4, cols 33-34) and the ledge flush with the lake seam (cols 24-31) lead up to lake_waterfall_path's west stub.

